<view class="page-shell candidates-page">
  <view class="page-heading"><text class="page-eyebrow">A FEW GOOD CHOICES</text><text class="page-title">都想吃？<text class="page-title-accent">找个饭友选。</text></text><text class="page-description">先摇出几道候选，再让同事帮你做决定。</text></view>
  <view class="candidate-list" wx:if="{{candidates.length > 0}}"><view class="candidate-item" wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="id"><view class="candidate-art"><food-illustration food="{{item}}" size="88" /></view><view class="item-info"><text class="item-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="item-category">{{item.categoryName}} · ￥{{item.priceRange}}</text></view><button class="replace-btn" bindtap="replaceOne" data-index="{{index}}" aria-label="替换{{item.name}}">换一道</button></view></view>
  <view class="surface empty-state" wx:else><image class="empty-illustration" src="/images/theme/food-default.png" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="empty-title">好吃的，马上就来</text><text class="empty-description">点一下，为这一餐准备几种可能。</text></view>
  <view class="actions"><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="generateCandidates">{{candidates.length > 0 ? '重新摇一组' : '摇出候选菜品'}}</button><button class="btn-secondary" open-type="share" wx:if="{{candidates.length > 0}}">让同事帮我选 →</button></view>
</view>
